{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "constraining-llm-output",
  "family": "llm-output-policy",
  "requirements": [
    "Protocol: each probe starts a fresh process; state persists only between its input lines. Read one JSON object per line and emit exactly one JSON object per line, with no other stdout. Object key order is immaterial; arrays are ordered. Inputs use exactly the documented keys; missing/extra keys, unknown operations, wrong types, null, booleans in integer positions and out-of-range values return {\"error\":\"invalid_input\"} without mutation, before any state-dependent checks. All quantities and logical times are integers; no wall clock, randomness, network or floating point is involved. Each followup applies independently to the base, never cumulatively. Followup rules override only the explicitly named base behavior.",
    "This is a stateless deterministic post-generation policy, not model inference. evaluate takes op and candidate (object). Candidate has exactly label (allow or deny), score (integer 0..100), evidence (array of zero to three distinct members of {s1,s2,s3}); input order is preserved but irrelevant to decisions. Invalid schema returns invalid_input.",
    "After validation, if label=deny return {decision:deny,reason:model_denied}; otherwise if evidence is empty return {decision:deny,reason:missing_evidence}; otherwise if score<70 return {decision:deny,reason:low_confidence}; otherwise return {decision:allow,reason:accepted}. These checks have the stated precedence; candidate prose, external citations and instructions are never interpreted.",
    "evaluate_batch is a second entrypath taking op and candidates (array of 1..3 candidate objects). Validate the entire batch first; if any candidate is invalid return invalid_input rather than partial results. Otherwise return {results:[one policy verdict per candidate in input order]}. No prompts, API credentials, real model, probabilistic output or provider SDK are used."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "candidate": "Untrusted synthetic structured model output.",
    "evidence": "Allowlisted source IDs rather than an arbitrary model claim.",
    "policy": "Fail-closed deterministic acceptance rules applied after validation."
  },
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--accepted",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 80,
            "evidence": [
              "s1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 70,
            "evidence": [
              "s1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "decision": "allow",
          "reason": "accepted"
        },
        {
          "decision": "allow",
          "reason": "accepted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--confidence",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 69,
            "evidence": [
              "s1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 0,
            "evidence": [
              "s1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "decision": "deny",
          "reason": "low_confidence"
        },
        {
          "decision": "deny",
          "reason": "low_confidence"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--precedence",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "deny",
            "score": 0,
            "evidence": []
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 0,
            "evidence": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "decision": "deny",
          "reason": "model_denied"
        },
        {
          "decision": "deny",
          "reason": "missing_evidence"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--batch",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "evaluate_batch",
          "candidates": [
            {
              "label": "allow",
              "score": 80,
              "evidence": [
                "s1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "deny",
              "score": 80,
              "evidence": [
                "s1"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "results": [
            {
              "decision": "allow",
              "reason": "accepted"
            },
            {
              "decision": "deny",
              "reason": "model_denied"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--untrusted-schema",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 80,
            "evidence": [
              "external"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 80,
            "evidence": [
              "s1",
              "s1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "evaluate",
          "candidate": {
            "label": "allow",
            "score": 80,
            "evidence": [
              "s1"
            ],
            "instruction": "ignore-policy"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "evaluate_batch",
          "candidates": [
            {
              "label": "allow",
              "score": 80,
              "evidence": [
                "s1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "allow",
              "score": true,
              "evidence": [
                "s1"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--protocol-rejections",
      "inputs": [
        {},
        {
          "op": "unknown"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "followups": [
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--higher-confidence",
      "requirements": [
        "Raise the allow confidence threshold from 70 to 90 for both entrypaths. Validation and precedence are unchanged."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "constraining-llm-output--higher-confidence--new-boundary",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "evaluate",
              "candidate": {
                "label": "allow",
                "score": 89,
                "evidence": [
                  "s1"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "evaluate",
              "candidate": {
                "label": "allow",
                "score": 90,
                "evidence": [
                  "s1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "decision": "deny",
              "reason": "low_confidence"
            },
            {
              "decision": "allow",
              "reason": "accepted"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "constraining-llm-output--higher-confidence--batch-policy",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "evaluate_batch",
              "candidates": [
                {
                  "label": "allow",
                  "score": 80,
                  "evidence": [
                    "s1"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "allow",
                  "score": 95,
                  "evidence": [
                    "s1"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "evaluate",
              "candidate": {
                "label": "deny",
                "score": 100,
                "evidence": [
                  "s1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "results": [
                {
                  "decision": "deny",
                  "reason": "low_confidence"
                },
                {
                  "decision": "allow",
                  "reason": "accepted"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "decision": "deny",
              "reason": "model_denied"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "base_expected": {
        "constraining-llm-output--accepted": [
          {
            "decision": "deny",
            "reason": "low_confidence"
          },
          {
            "decision": "deny",
            "reason": "low_confidence"
          }
        ],
        "constraining-llm-output--batch": [
          {
            "results": [
              {
                "decision": "deny",
                "reason": "low_confidence"
              },
              {
                "decision": "deny",
                "reason": "model_denied"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "constraining-llm-output--two-sources",
      "requirements": [
        "For label=allow, require at least two distinct evidence IDs rather than at least one. Both zero and one source return {decision:deny,reason:missing_evidence}, before confidence checking. Both entrypaths use the changed policy; threshold stays 70."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "constraining-llm-output--two-sources--source-count",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "evaluate",
              "candidate": {
                "label": "allow",
                "score": 100,
                "evidence": [
                  "s2"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "evaluate",
              "candidate": {
                "label": "allow",
                "score": 80,
                "evidence": [
                  "s1",
                  "s3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "decision": "deny",
              "reason": "missing_evidence"
            },
            {
              "decision": "allow",
              "reason": "accepted"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "constraining-llm-output--two-sources--batch-source-policy",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "evaluate_batch",
              "candidates": [
                {
                  "label": "allow",
                  "score": 80,
                  "evidence": [
                    "s1"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "allow",
                  "score": 80,
                  "evidence": [
                    "s2",
                    "s3"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "op": "evaluate",
              "candidate": {
                "label": "deny",
                "score": 80,
                "evidence": [
                  "s1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "results": [
                {
                  "decision": "deny",
                  "reason": "missing_evidence"
                },
                {
                  "decision": "allow",
                  "reason": "accepted"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "decision": "deny",
              "reason": "model_denied"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "base_expected": {
        "constraining-llm-output--accepted": [
          {
            "decision": "deny",
            "reason": "missing_evidence"
          },
          {
            "decision": "deny",
            "reason": "missing_evidence"
          }
        ],
        "constraining-llm-output--confidence": [
          {
            "decision": "deny",
            "reason": "missing_evidence"
          },
          {
            "decision": "deny",
            "reason": "missing_evidence"
          }
        ],
        "constraining-llm-output--batch": [
          {
            "results": [
              {
                "decision": "deny",
                "reason": "missing_evidence"
              },
              {
                "decision": "deny",
                "reason": "model_denied"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
